            '2026-03-11T13:07:23.134000+00:00',
            $TRANS$It is hereby clarified that according to this exercise method, the options can be exercised for a number of shares that reflect only the amount of the benefit. It is further clarified that the bidder will not pay the exercise price, which, as stated, is used only for the purpose of calculating the amount of the benefit. 1.2. Vesting Period 1.2.1. The options will be subject to vesting periods, as detailed below: 1.2.1.1. The first tranche – 25% of the number of warrants allocated to the offeror will mature at the end of 12 months, from the relevant date in relation to the offer and as determined by the company's board of directors. 1.2.1.2.$TRANS$
