            $TRANS$After this date, all options will expire whether they have matured or not yet matured by that date. 1.2.6. It should be noted that during the aforesaid 90 days, the closing price of the Company's share will be calculated for the purpose of calculating the cashless exercise mechanism described in clause 1.1.3 above as the last known price of the Company's share on the TASE prior to delisting from trading. 1.2.7. Options that have not yet matured on the date of termination of the employment relationship (or engagement) between the Offeror and a company or a related company will expire on the date of termination of the employment relationship and will not be exerciseable, subject to acceleration of maturity dates (to the extent determined in an allocation agreement or plan).$TRANS$
