            $TRANS$Before Ex-Dividend Day. 1.3.3. Benefit Shares. In the event of a distribution of Benefit Shares, the determining day for their distribution will apply after the date of the allotment of the Warrants but before the exercise of the Warrants and before the expiration of the Offers' entitlement to exercise them, the number of shares deriving from the exercise of the Warrants that were granted but not yet exercised will be adjusted, so that the number of shares to which the Option Holder will be entitled as a result of the exercise of the Options, will increase or decrease proportionately in the number of shares of the same type that the Offeror would have been entitled to below as Benefit Shares if he exercised the options held by him. The redemption price will not change. 1.3.4.$TRANS$
