            '2026-03-11T13:07:23.132000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The exercise of the options offered for shares by the Offeror will be executed on a net exercise basis (without cash - Cashless Exercise), in such a way that the Offeror will not be required to actually pay the exercise price, except for the amount of the face value of the shares that will actually be allocated to him, and the amount of shares allocated to the actual Offeror will be calculated in accordance with the difference between: (a) The closing price of the Company's shares on the TASE on the trading day preceding the exercise date, multiplied by the number of shares subject to the options in respect of which the exercise notice was given;  Between: (b) the exercise price is multiplied by the number of options, in respect of which the exercise notice was given.$TRANS$
