            $TRANS$In the event that, prior to the exercise of the options, the Company offers securities to the Company's ordinary shareholders by way of rights, then, with respect to options that have not yet been exercised by the date of the decision for the issuance of the rights, there will be no adjustment in the exercise price of the options, but rather the number of shares that will derive from the exercise of each option, which have not yet been exercised on the date of determining the right to the Offeror in the allocation of rights – the number of shares deriving from the exercise of these options will be adjusted to the rights benefit component.  As expressed in the ratio between the closing price of the stock on the stock exchange on the last trading day before the "X day",$TRANS$
